  "changed": [
    "Pro 3: 'Customizable views and dashboards to organize projects and track progress effectively.' was replaced by 'Readily available and easy-to-access customizable views for project organization and tracking.' because the note '[benefit] A Board (Kanban) view tab already existed on the list next to List, so the Kanban view needed one click rather than setup.' provided a more ClickUp-specific and positive spin on view accessibility.",
    "Con 2: 'User interface can feel overwhelming or confusing to navigate at times.' was replaced by 'User interface can feel overwhelming or confusing to navigate, with elements sometimes obscuring content.' because the note '[friction] A Brain AI chat panel opened by default and took about a third of the screen, which squeezed the list so task names and the custom field column were truncated.' directly illustrated how UI elements contribute to the overwhelming/confusing experience by obscuring content."
  ]
